  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMPASS 2015 Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is engaging 4 partners to conduct participatory research to include the voices of those living in poverty in the post-2015 debate. Unitas will conduct one of these research projects. Research participants will play a key role in identifying key aspects of social inequality and poverty and in the reflection on the causes. The research will take place in 5 ecologically different areas and in each of these areas will comprise both rural and urban settings. The research will be conducted in dialogue with the research coordinator based in London. The findings will be used for local and global advocacy purposes.</narrative>
  </description>
